Bounded PHP YARA-X discovery contribution

This bundle builds on the PHP detection work in bigfix/Site_Rapid_Response.
The php-detect.yar rules are copied unchanged from that project's original PHP
discovery content. Existing rule comments and attribution are preserved.

The bounded scanner implementations, parameter-only Console form, compact
reporting Analysis and maintenance helpers are additions to that work.

